{"seq":1,"slug":"lobby-service-design","title":"大厅服务设计：有状态架构、Actor 模型与 Agones 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/lobby-service-design","wordCount":1542,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大厅服务设计-有状态架构-actor-模型与-agones-集成\">大厅服务设计：有状态架构、Actor 模型与 Agones 集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>有状态服务</strong></td>\n<td>房间状态驻留在服务内存中，操作无需往返外部存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Actor 模型</strong></td>\n<td>每个房间封装为独立 Actor，通过消息队列串行处理，天然无锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Agones</strong></td>\n<td>Kubernetes 上的游戏服务器管理框架，提供 Fleet（服务器池）和 GameServerAllocation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>粘性路由</strong></td>\n<td>WebSocket 长连接需要将同一玩家的请求路由到持有其 Room 的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>写前日志（WAL）</strong></td>\n<td>Actor 状态变更先写 WAL 再更新内存，服务重启时从 WAL 恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心问题-大厅服务该如何持有状态\">核心问题：大厅服务该如何持有状态？</h2><p>多人游戏大厅的状态（哪些玩家在哪个房间、房间当前处于什么状态）天然需要被&quot;持有&quot;在某处。最直觉的做法是用数据库存储所有状态，服务本身保持无状态；但这样每次操作都需要往返数据库，对于高频的心跳更新、玩家状态变更等操作，延迟代价高昂。另一个极端是把所有状态完全驻留在服务内存中，延迟极低，但服务重启会丢失所有房间状态。</p>\n<p>生产实践中通常采用<strong>有状态服务 + 持久化快照</strong>的混合方案：房间状态在内存中高速操作，定期或在关键节点（创建、状态变更、玩家加入/退出）写入持久化存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有状态-vs-无状态架构对比\">有状态 vs 无状态架构对比</h2><h3 id=\"纯无状态架构\">纯无状态架构</h3><p>所有房间状态存储在 Redis 或数据库中。每个请求先读取状态，处理后写回。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Client → LB → Any Lobby Server → Redis\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Client → LB → Any Lobby Server → Redis</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：服务可以任意扩缩容，部署简单，无需考虑请求路由到正确实例。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次操作 2 次 Redis 往返（读 + 写），P99 延迟约 5~10ms</li>\n<li>并发修改需要分布式锁，Redis SETNX + Lua 脚本，实现复杂</li>\n<li>玩家的 WebSocket 长连接需要粘性路由（Sticky Session）或消息广播层，否则无法推送消息</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际上纯无状态对于大厅场景并不成立，因为 WebSocket 长连接本身就引入了状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"有状态服务架构-actor-model\">有状态服务架构（Actor Model）</h3><p>每个房间作为独立的 Actor（或 Goroutine/Erlang Process），房间的所有状态和行为封装在其中。Actor 通过消息队列顺序处理操作，天然避免并发竞争问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Client → LB/Gateway → Room Actor (in-memory state)&#10;                              ↓ async&#10;                         Persistence Layer (write-ahead log)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Client → LB/Gateway → Room Actor (in-memory state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                              ↓ async</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                         Persistence Layer (write-ahead log)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>操作在内存中完成，延迟极低（微秒级）</li>\n<li>无需分布式锁，Actor 串行处理消息保证一致性</li>\n<li>代码模型清晰，每个 Actor 是独立的状态机</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>请求必须路由到持有该房间的正确实例（需要一致性哈希或服务注册）</li>\n<li>Actor 所在节点宕机时需要从持久化存储恢复（故障恢复复杂度高）</li>\n<li>单 Actor 是性能瓶颈（虽然通常每个房间的并发很低）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"实现示例-go-中的-room-actor\">实现示例：Go 中的 Room Actor</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type RoomActor struct {&#10;    id      string&#10;    state   RoomState&#10;    players map[string]*Player&#10;    inbox   chan Message&#10;    store   RoomStore // 持久化接口&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Message struct {&#10;    Type    MessageType&#10;    Payload any&#10;    Reply   chan&lt;- Response&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (r *RoomActor) Run(ctx context.Context) {&#10;    for {&#10;        select {&#10;        case msg := &lt;-r.inbox:&#10;            r.handleMessage(msg)&#10;        case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;            r.persist() // 关闭前持久化&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (r *RoomActor) handleMessage(msg Message) {&#10;    switch msg.Type {&#10;    case MsgJoin:&#10;        req := msg.Payload.(JoinRequest)&#10;        resp := r.processJoin(req)&#10;        if msg.Reply != nil {&#10;            msg.Reply &lt;- resp&#10;        }&#10;    case MsgLeave:&#10;        // ...&#10;    case MsgReady:&#10;        // ...&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 外部调用：发送消息并等待响应&#10;func (r *RoomActor) Join(ctx context.Context, req JoinRequest) (Response, error) {&#10;    reply := make(chan Response, 1)&#10;    select {&#10;    case r.inbox &lt;- Message{Type: MsgJoin, Payload: req, Reply: reply}:&#10;    case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;        return Response{}, ctx.Err()&#10;    }&#10;    select {&#10;    case resp := &lt;-reply:&#10;        return resp, nil&#10;    case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;        return Response{}, ctx.Err()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    state   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    players </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Player</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inbox   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    store   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomStore</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 持久化接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Type    </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MessageType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Payload </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">any</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Reply   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r.inbox:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">persist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 关闭前持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.Type {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MsgJoin:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        req </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.Payload.(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JoinRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        resp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">processJoin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg.Reply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            msg.Reply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MsgLeave:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MsgReady:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 外部调用：发送消息并等待响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JoinRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.inbox </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Message{Type: MsgJoin, Payload: req, Reply: reply}:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reply:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计点：<code>inbox</code> 是缓冲 Channel，避免发送方阻塞；每个 Message 携带 <code>Reply</code> Channel 实现请求-响应模式；Actor 的 <code>Run</code> 循环是单 Goroutine，无锁操作内部状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"actor-框架选型\">Actor 框架选型</h2><h3 id=\"原生-goroutine-go\">原生 Goroutine（Go）</h3><p>适合中小规模场景。直接用 Goroutine + Channel 实现，无依赖。缺点是 Actor 的监督树（supervisor tree，即父 Actor 管理子 Actor 的生命周期）需要手写。</p>\n<h3 id=\"akka-jvm-pekko\">Akka（JVM）/ Pekko</h3><p>工业级 Actor 框架，提供监督树、持久化（Event Sourcing）、集群路由（Akka Cluster Sharding）。<code>Cluster Sharding</code> 是关键特性：它自动将 Actor（如 Room Actor）路由到集群中的正确节点，无需手动管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"// Akka Cluster Sharding 示例&#10;val sharding = ClusterSharding(system)&#10;val roomShardRegion = sharding.init(&#10;  Entity(RoomActor.TypeKey)(ctx =&gt; RoomActor(ctx.entityId))&#10;    .withStopMessage(RoomActor.Stop)&#10;)&#10;&#10;// 向特定房间发送消息（自动路由到正确节点）&#10;roomShardRegion ! ShardingEnvelope(&quot;room-123&quot;, JoinRequest(playerId = &quot;player-456&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Akka Cluster Sharding 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val sharding = ClusterSharding(system)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val roomShardRegion = sharding.init(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Entity(RoomActor.TypeKey)(ctx => RoomActor(ctx.entityId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .withStopMessage(RoomActor.Stop)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 向特定房间发送消息（自动路由到正确节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>roomShardRegion ! ShardingEnvelope(\"room-123\", JoinRequest(playerId = \"player-456\"))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"erlang-elixir-phoenix\">Erlang/Elixir + Phoenix</h3><p>天然 Actor 模型（每个 Erlang Process 是轻量级 Actor），Phoenix Channel 为 WebSocket 提供内建的 PubSub 和 Presence（玩家在线状态）支持。适合实时通信密集的大厅场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"microsoft-orleans\">Microsoft Orleans</h3><p>.NET 生态的虚拟 Actor 框架，&quot;虚拟&quot;意味着 Actor 按需激活、不活跃时自动休眠（Deactivate），可无缝持久化到 Azure Table/Redis 等存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"agones-专为游戏-server-设计的-kubernetes-扩展\">Agones：专为游戏 Server 设计的 Kubernetes 扩展</h2><p>Agones 是 Google 开源的游戏服务器管理框架，运行在 Kubernetes 之上，专门解决游戏 Dedicated Server（专属服务器）的生命周期管理问题。</p>\n<p>Agones 的核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GameServer</strong>：一个运行游戏服务端进程的 Pod，有自己的状态机（Portforward → RequestReady → Ready → Allocated → Shutdown）</li>\n<li><strong>Fleet</strong>：GameServer 的副本集，维护一个&quot;准备好&quot;的服务器池，类似 Deployment 但面向游戏服务器</li>\n<li><strong>GameServerAllocation</strong>：从 Fleet 中分配一个 Ready 状态的 GameServer，用于承载具体对局</li>\n</ul>\n<p>大厅与 Agones 的集成方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Lobby Service               Agones API Server&#10;     |                            |&#10;     |  -- GET /gameservers --&gt;   |  (查询可用服务器)&#10;     |                            |&#10;     | Match Ready Event          |&#10;     |  -- GameServerAllocation   |&#10;     |     (allocate a server) -&gt; |&#10;     |                            |&#10;     | &lt;-- Allocated Server IP:Port&#10;     |&#10;     | --&gt; notify players (IP:Port to connect)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Lobby Service               Agones API Server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |                            |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |  -- GET /gameservers -->   |  (查询可用服务器)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |                            |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     | Match Ready Event          |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |  -- GameServerAllocation   |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |     (allocate a server) -> |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |                            |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     | &#x3C;-- Allocated Server IP:Port</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     | --> notify players (IP:Port to connect)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Lobby 服务在比赛准备就绪时，向 Agones API 发起 <code>GameServerAllocation</code> 请求，指定标签选择器（如区域、游戏模式），Agones 原子性地将一个 Ready 状态的服务器切换为 Allocated，并返回其 IP:Port。Lobby 服务将地址通知给所有玩家，玩家直接连接游戏服务器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GameServerAllocation 请求示例&#10;apiVersion: allocation.agones.dev/v1&#10;kind: GameServerAllocation&#10;spec:&#10;  required:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      game-mode: &#39;ranked-5v5&#39;&#10;      region: &#39;ap-southeast-1&#39;&#10;  preferred:&#10;    - matchLabels:&#10;        ping-region: &#39;cn-shanghai&#39;&#10;  scheduling: Packed # 尽量填满现有节点再扩展新节点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GameServerAllocation 请求示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">allocation.agones.dev/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GameServerAllocation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      game-mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ranked-5v5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ap-southeast-1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  preferred</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ping-region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cn-shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scheduling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Packed</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 尽量填满现有节点再扩展新节点</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"大厅服务的-api-层设计\">大厅服务的 API 层设计</h2><p>大厅服务对外暴露两类接口：</p>\n<p><strong>REST/gRPC（操作类）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>POST /lobby/rooms</code> — 创建房间</li>\n<li><code>POST /lobby/rooms/{id}/join</code> — 加入房间</li>\n<li><code>POST /lobby/rooms/{id}/ready</code> — 准备就绪</li>\n<li><code>DELETE /lobby/rooms/{id}/leave</code> — 离开房间</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>WebSocket（推送类）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>玩家加入大厅时建立 WebSocket 连接</li>\n<li>服务端推送房间状态变更（玩家加入/离开/准备/聊天消息/倒计时）</li>\n<li>保持单一长连接，避免轮询</li>\n</ul>\n<p>架构决策树：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>房间数量 &lt; 10万，单机或小集群 → Go Goroutine + Channel Actor</li>\n<li>需要 JVM 生态、集群自动路由 → Akka Cluster Sharding</li>\n<li>.NET 栈、需要 Actor 自动休眠 → Orleans</li>\n<li>Erlang/Elixir 团队 → Phoenix LiveView + Phoenix.Presence</li>\n<li>需要 Kubernetes 原生游戏服务器管理 → Agones Fleet + Allocation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"大厅服务整体架构图\">大厅服务整体架构图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    C[客户端 WebSocket] --&gt; GW[API Gateway / LB]&#10;    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N1[Lobby Node 1]&#10;    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N2[Lobby Node 2]&#10;    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N3[Lobby Node 3]&#10;&#10;    subgraph N1[Lobby Node 1]&#10;        RA1[Room Actor A]&#10;        RA2[Room Actor B]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    N1 --&gt;|异步持久化| Redis[(Redis Snapshot)]&#10;    N1 --&gt;|GameServerAllocation| Agones[Agones API Server]&#10;    Agones --&gt;|分配| Fleet[GameServer Fleet]&#10;    Fleet --&gt; GS[Game Server Pod]\">graph TB\n    C[客户端 WebSocket] --&gt; GW[API Gateway / LB]\n    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N1[Lobby Node 1]\n    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N2[Lobby Node 2]\n    GW --&gt;|一致性哈希路由| N3[Lobby Node 3]\n\n    subgraph N1[Lobby Node 1]\n        RA1[Room Actor A]\n        RA2[Room Actor B]\n    end\n\n    N1 --&gt;|异步持久化| Redis[(Redis Snapshot)]\n    N1 --&gt;|GameServerAllocation| Agones[Agones API Server]\n    Agones --&gt;|分配| Fleet[GameServer Fleet]\n    Fleet --&gt; GS[Game Server Pod]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>大厅服务的核心架构选择是<strong>有状态 Actor 模型</strong>：每个 Room 是独立的 Actor，房间状态在内存中高速操作，通过异步写入保持持久化。Actor 串行处理消息天然避免并发竞争，无需分布式锁。Agones 解决了游戏服务器（Dedicated Server）的生命周期管理问题，大厅服务在比赛准备完成时通过 <code>GameServerAllocation</code> 请求分配服务器，然后通知玩家连接。选型时根据技术栈选择合适的 Actor 框架（Go Goroutine、Akka、Orleans、Phoenix），核心设计原则一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大厅服务设计：有状态架构、Actor 模型与 Agones 集成","id":"大厅服务设计-有状态架构-actor-模型与-agones-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心问题：大厅服务该如何持有状态？","id":"核心问题-大厅服务该如何持有状态"},{"level":2,"text":"有状态 vs 无状态架构对比","id":"有状态-vs-无状态架构对比"},{"level":3,"text":"纯无状态架构","id":"纯无状态架构"},{"level":3,"text":"有状态服务架构（Actor Model）","id":"有状态服务架构-actor-model"},{"level":3,"text":"实现示例：Go 中的 Room Actor","id":"实现示例-go-中的-room-actor"},{"level":2,"text":"Actor 框架选型","id":"actor-框架选型"},{"level":3,"text":"原生 Goroutine（Go）","id":"原生-goroutine-go"},{"level":3,"text":"Akka（JVM）/ Pekko","id":"akka-jvm-pekko"},{"level":3,"text":"Erlang/Elixir + Phoenix","id":"erlang-elixir-phoenix"},{"level":3,"text":"Microsoft Orleans","id":"microsoft-orleans"},{"level":2,"text":"Agones：专为游戏 Server 设计的 Kubernetes 扩展","id":"agones-专为游戏-server-设计的-kubernetes-扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"大厅服务的 API 层设计","id":"大厅服务的-api-层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"大厅服务整体架构图","id":"大厅服务整体架构图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"会话管理：Session Token、心跳与超时迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/session-management"}}